Uplink's WhatsApp helper (sidecar/whatsapp)

This Source Code Form is subject to the terms of the Mozilla Public License, v. 2.0. If a copy of the MPL was not
distributed with this file, You can obtain one at https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/.

It is built on whatsmeow (https://github.com/tulir/whatsmeow), Copyright (c) Tulir Asokan and contributors, also under
the Mozilla Public License 2.0, whose source is at that address; and on go-sqlite3
(https://github.com/mattn/go-sqlite3), Copyright (c) Yasuhiro Matsumoto, under the MIT licence, which includes SQLite
(public domain). Their own licence files come with their source in the Go module cache (go.mod pins the versions).

The helper's source is published with every release of Uplink that ships it.
